# Test Intent: AsyncLoading

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the file `probes/async-loading/index.html`.

## Desired Flow

I opened the page. It first showed "Loading your balance…", then after a short
moment the balance appeared. I read the balance once it had loaded.

## Element Hints

- The balance loads after a short, variable delay. The test should wait for the
  balance to appear (wait on its state), not wait a fixed number of seconds.

## Values to Capture

- The available balance, in EUR (e.g. "8640.00").

## Success Criteria

Once loading finishes, the balance is visible and is a number greater than zero.

